#: lib/ex_blog_web/components/showcase.ex:152
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Borrowed from Phoenix routers, Ecto schemas, Oban workers and OTP supervision trees. Not a framework you disappear into."
msgstr "Preso in prestito dai router di Phoenix, dagli schema Ecto, dai worker Oban e dagli alberi di supervisione OTP. Non un framework in cui sparire."

#: lib/ex_blog_web/components/showcase.ex:303
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Elixir-first planning toolkit: Action Language in, validated tool calls out. No JSON schema in the prompt."
msgstr "Toolkit di pianificazione Elixir-first: entra Action Language, escono chiamate validate. Nessuno schema JSON nel prompt."

#: lib/ex_blog_web/components/showcase.ex:120
